# React Flow render

Follow `REACTFLOW_RENDER.md`. Phase 1 removed `packages/extensions/format-reactflow/`. Phase 8
restores the encoder and this document into `packages/app/src/graph/` from the `pre-reset` tag.

Non-negotiables:

- Published edges are **`data` or `route`**. Data edges come from `$ref` / `$state` (including
  nested paths and `.when()` gates) with handles. Route edges publish parallel / branch / loop
  structure. Strip unlabeled layout-control edges; never invent fake `$ref`s for structure.
- Do not emit `ecp-group` / `parentId` containers. Structure is shown with route connectors.
- Port bindings are literals and refs; make sure output and nested input handles exist for every
  edged ref.
- Fan-out through multiple `$ref`s is supported. Don't invent multi-source fan-in on one input
  key.
